@startuml Writing_Grading_Flow
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Writing Test & AI Grading Flow

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 20
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    ActorBackgroundColor #4caf50
    RectangleBackgroundColor #37474f
    RectangleBorderColor #78909c
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
}

actor "Authenticated User" as User #lightgreen

rectangle "Frontend Pages" {
    rectangle "Writing Test\n[/test/writing/:source/:testNum]" as WritingPage {
        frame "Layout" {
            (Task Prompt Panel)
            (Essay Editor Panel)
            (Resizable Divider)
        }
        frame "Task Switcher" {
            (Task 1: 150+ words)
            (Task 2: 250+ words)
        }
    }
    
    rectangle "Writing Review\n[/test/writing/review/:attemptId]" as WritingReview {
        frame "AI Feedback" {
            (Overall Band Score)
            (4 Criteria Scores)
        }
        frame "Analysis" {
            (Error Highlights)
            (Paragraph Analysis)
            (Sample Essays)
        }
    }
    
    [GradingQuotaInfo] as QuotaInfo
    [GradingLoader] as Loader
}

rectangle "Frontend State" {
    [useTestStore] as TestStore
    [useQuotaStore] as QuotaStore
}

rectangle "Backend Services" {
    [WritingController] as WritingCtrl
    [WritingSubmissionService] as WritingSvc
    [AsyncGradingService] as AsyncSvc
    [LLMGradingService] as LLMSvc
    [SubscriptionService] as SubSvc
}

cloud "External AI" {
    [DeepSeek API\n(V3.2)] as DeepSeek
}

database "Database" {
    [writing_submissions]
    [user_subscriptions]
}

' Writing Flow
User --> WritingPage : Start Writing Test
WritingPage --> TestStore : Essay State (essays{1,2})
WritingPage --> WritingCtrl : saveDraft(attemptId, taskNumber, text)

' Pre-Submit Quota Check
WritingPage --> QuotaInfo : Display remaining gradings
QuotaInfo --> SubSvc : checkAIGradingAllowed(userId)

' Submit for Grading
WritingPage --> WritingCtrl : submitForGrading(attemptId, essays[])
WritingCtrl --> WritingSvc : Submit Essays

' Rate Limit Check
WritingSvc --> WritingSvc : Rate limit check (5 req/min)

' Async Grading
WritingSvc --> AsyncSvc : Trigger background grading
AsyncSvc --> LLMSvc : gradeSubmission() per task
LLMSvc --> DeepSeek : API Request (system + user prompt)
DeepSeek --> LLMSvc : JSON Response
LLMSvc --> writing_submissions : Update with scores

' Polling
WritingPage --> Loader : Show loading animation
Loader --> WritingCtrl : getGradingStatus(attemptId) [3s interval]
WritingCtrl --> WritingSvc : Check status
WritingSvc --> WritingReview : Redirect when GRADED

' Review
WritingReview --> WritingCtrl : getWritingReview(attemptId)
WritingCtrl --> WritingSvc : Get full review + feedback

note right of LLMSvc
  **LLMGradingService:**
  - resolveApiKey(): User key > Server key
  - buildSystemPrompt(): IELTS band descriptors
  - buildUserPrompt(): Task + essay + image desc
  - callLLMApi(): OpenAI-compatible format
  - parseAndApplyGradingResults()
  - roundToNearestHalf(): 0.5 band rounding
end note

note bottom of DeepSeek
  **DeepSeek V3.2 Models:**
  - deepseek-chat (default)
  - deepseek-reasoner
  
  **Response JSON:**
  - overall_band
  - task_achievement
  - coherence_cohesion
  - lexical_resource
  - grammatical_accuracy
  - feedback (detailed)
  - sample_essay
end note

note left of WritingReview
  **Error Highlight Colors:**
  - Grammar: red
  - Spelling: yellow
  - Vocabulary: purple
  - Punctuation: blue
  - Coherence: green
  - Style: yellow
end note

@enduml
